{"id":"vd-a2-the-new-city","level":"a2","n":18,"title":{"en":"I Miss Home","vi":"Con nhớ nhà"},"summary":"Sau vài tuần ở Northgate, Tariq nói chuyện qua video với Sami — cậu nhớ nhà và lo mình sẽ không có bạn mới.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-new-city","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The New City","vi":"Thành phố mới"}},"scene":{"background":"home-evening","weather":"rain","props":[{"id":"phone","x":820}]},"cast":{"tariq":{"name":{"en":"Tariq","vi":"Tariq"},"look":"teenboy","x":560,"style":{"hair":"curly","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#B07650","skinShade":"#94603E","outfit":"tee","top":"#5DBB63","topShade":"#4AA350"}},"sami":{"name":{"en":"Sami","vi":"Sami"},"look":"teenboy","x":1180,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#3A2A22","skin":"#D9A27A","skinShade":"#C48A62","outfit":"tee","top":"#E9A23B","topShade":"#D18B28"},"call":{"bg":"home-day"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"sami","en":"Tariq! How's Northgate?","vi":"Tariq! Northgate thế nào?","ipa":["ˌtɑˈɹik","haʊz","ˈnɔɹθˌɡeɪt"],"start":0.554,"end":1.944,"expression":"happy","gesture":"wave","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.239],[2,1.444]]},{"speaker":"tariq","en":"Grey. It rains every day.","vi":"Xám xịt. Ngày nào cũng mưa.","ipa":["ɡɹeɪ","ɪt","ɹeɪnz","ˈɛvɚi","deɪ"],"start":2.734,"end":4.824,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,2.734],[1,3.438],[2,3.642],[3,4.063],[4,4.417]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"And your new school?","vi":"Còn trường mới của cậu?","ipa":["ənd","jɔɹ","nu","skul"],"start":5.614,"end":6.224,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,5.614],[1,5.662],[2,5.758],[3,5.891]]},{"speaker":"tariq","en":"It's OK. The students are polite.","vi":"Cũng được. Học sinh đều lịch sự.","ipa":["ɪts","oʊˈkeɪ","ðə","ˈstudənts","ɑɹ","pəˈlaɪt"],"start":7.014,"end":9.404,"expression":"neutral","timing":[[0,7.014],[1,7.107],[2,8.005],[3,8.086],[4,8.711],[5,8.928]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"But?","vi":"Nhưng mà?","ipa":["bʌt"],"start":10.194,"end":10.324,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,10.194]]},{"speaker":"tariq","en":"But I don't know a single person. I sit alone at lunch.","vi":"Nhưng tớ chẳng quen một ai. Giờ ăn trưa tớ ngồi một mình.","ipa":["bʌt","aɪ","doʊnt","noʊ","ə","ˈsɪŋɡəl","ˈpɝsən","aɪ","sɪt","əˈloʊn","æt","lʌntʃ"],"start":11.114,"end":14.894,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,11.114],[1,11.239],[2,11.347],[3,11.565],[4,11.796],[5,11.864],[6,12.298],[7,13.317],[8,13.399],[9,13.657],[10,14.146],[11,14.323]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"That sounds lonely.","vi":"Nghe cô đơn thật.","ipa":["ðæt","saʊndz","ˈloʊnli"],"start":15.684,"end":16.414,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,15.684],[1,15.758],[2,16.011]]},{"speaker":"tariq","en":"I miss home. I miss our team. I miss you, too.","vi":"Tớ nhớ nhà. Tớ nhớ đội bóng của mình. Tớ cũng nhớ cậu nữa.","ipa":["aɪ","mɪs","hoʊm","aɪ","mɪs","ˈaʊɚ","tim","aɪ","mɪs","ju","tu"],"start":17.204,"end":20.614,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,17.204],[1,17.24],[2,17.471],[3,18.313],[4,18.381],[5,18.666],[6,18.83],[7,19.726],[8,19.794],[9,20.066],[10,20.256]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"I miss you, too. The team isn't the same without you.","vi":"Tớ cũng nhớ cậu. Đội bóng không còn như trước khi thiếu cậu.","ipa":["aɪ","mɪs","ju","tu","ðə","tim","ˈɪzənt","ðə","seɪm","wɪˈθaʊt","ju"],"start":21.404,"end":24.174,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,21.404],[1,21.44],[2,21.621],[3,21.741],[4,22.39],[5,22.45],[6,22.919],[7,23.135],[8,23.219],[9,23.544],[10,23.928]]},{"speaker":"tariq","en":"I'm worried that nobody here will ever talk to me.","vi":"Tớ lo là ở đây sẽ chẳng ai thèm nói chuyện với tớ.","ipa":["aɪm","ˈwɝid","ðæt","ˈnoʊˌbɑˌdi","hiɹ","wɪl","ˈɛvɚ","tɔk","tu","mi"],"start":24.964,"end":27.694,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,24.964],[1,25.089],[2,25.523],[3,25.727],[4,26.135],[5,26.474],[6,26.692],[7,26.95],[8,27.276],[9,27.398]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"It's hard to start again. But it'll get better.","vi":"Bắt đầu lại thì khó thật. Nhưng rồi sẽ ổn thôi.","ipa":["ɪts","hɑɹd","tu","stɑɹt","əˈɡɛn","bʌt","ˈɪtəl","ɡɛt","ˈbɛtɚ"],"start":28.484,"end":30.504,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,28.484],[1,28.556],[2,28.761],[3,28.809],[4,29.061],[5,29.758],[6,29.842],[7,29.987],[8,30.167]]},{"speaker":"tariq","en":"How do you know?","vi":"Sao cậu biết?","ipa":["haʊ","du","ju","noʊ"],"start":31.294,"end":31.944,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,31.294],[1,31.395],[2,31.504],[3,31.626]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"Is there a football team at your school?","vi":"Trường cậu có đội bóng không?","ipa":["ɪz","ðɛɹ","ə","ˈfʊtˌbɔl","tim","æt","jɔɹ","skul"],"start":32.734,"end":34.094,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,32.734],[1,32.806],[2,32.938],[3,32.999],[4,33.371],[5,33.563],[6,33.648],[7,33.756]]},{"speaker":"tariq","en":"I think so. Training is on Thursdays.","vi":"Hình như có. Thứ Năm có buổi tập.","ipa":["aɪ","θɪŋk","soʊ","ˈtɹeɪnɪŋ","ɪz","ɑn","ˈθɝzdeɪz"],"start":34.884,"end":37.664,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,34.884],[1,34.914],[2,35.145],[3,35.963],[4,36.466],[5,36.697],[6,36.914]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"Then go! That's how you met me, remember?","vi":"Vậy thì đi đi! Hồi đó cậu cũng quen tớ như vậy mà, nhớ không?","ipa":["ðɛn","ɡoʊ","ðæts","haʊ","ju","mɛt","mi","ɹɪˈmɛmbɚ"],"start":38.454,"end":40.494,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,38.454],[1,38.55],[2,39.211],[3,39.356],[4,39.476],[5,39.596],[6,39.788],[7,40.125]]},{"speaker":"tariq","en":"You're right. OK, I'll go on Thursday.","vi":"Cậu nói đúng. Được, thứ Năm tớ sẽ đi.","ipa":["jʊɹ","ɹaɪt","oʊˈkeɪ","aɪl","ɡoʊ","ɑn","ˈθɝzˌdeɪ"],"start":41.284,"end":43.654,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,41.284],[1,41.409],[2,42.237],[3,42.468],[4,42.659],[5,42.835],[6,42.998]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"I'm sure you'll score. Tell me everything!","vi":"Tớ chắc là cậu sẽ ghi bàn. Kể hết cho tớ nhé!","ipa":["aɪm","ʃʊɹ","jul","skɔɹ","tɛl","mi","ˈɛvɹiˌθɪŋ"],"start":44.444,"end":46.374,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","react":{"tariq":"happy"},"timing":[[0,44.444],[1,44.528],[2,44.745],[3,44.877],[4,45.67],[5,45.79],[6,45.911]]}],"words":[{"id":"miss","en":"miss","ipa":"mɪs","vi":